      </p>
    </figure>

    <div class="prose">
      <div class="chapter-mark">Stepping away</div>

      <p>
        The experience was incredibly rewarding. Eventually, I relocated to the UK
        to pursue my PhD, and I made the difficult decision to step away from the
        platform. Because of its strong visibility and reputation — achieved
        through effective SEO — it had reached a high ranking in Google search
        results and was easily accessible to its target audience. This made it
        <strong>valuable enough to sell</strong>, ensuring its continued impact.
      </p>

      <h2><span class="grad">Why SEO mattered</span></h2>

      <p>
        A key element of this success was my use of SEO skills. I intentionally
        applied digital strategies to connect healthcare expertise with those who
        needed it most. I believe strongly that in today's digital era, technology
        and the internet give us powerful tools to reach and support specific
        communities — and I am passionate about using those tools to create
        <strong>meaningful, positive impact.</strong>
      </p>
    </div>
